{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/8c0e0ea784f8659f10a478bb528d2856.avif?t=1765027934\" width=1560 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brilliant, burnt-out, possibly cursed \u2013 you play as operant Hershel Wilk, alias CASCADE. Five years ago you led your team into the abyss and have been haunted by your failures ever since. Now you've been recalled for a mysterious assignment that may give you a chance to prove yourself again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/a9e26454c722bd843602c65e74f0368a.poster.avif?t=1765027934\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/a9e26454c722bd843602c65e74f0368a.webm?t=1765027934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/a9e26454c722bd843602c65e74f0368a.mp4?t=1765027934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/7d0d5fbf5c24b8f737c831d961a692ce.webp?t=1765027934\" width=1560 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find yourself thrown into a three-way struggle for cultural and ideological power, played out across an unforgettable new city. In ZERO PARADES, the world itself is a character with its own secrets, traumas, and miracles for you to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/394eaba703d25bac2988e7a3588b2a9c.poster.avif?t=1765027934\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/394eaba703d25bac2988e7a3588b2a9c.webm?t=1765027934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/394eaba703d25bac2988e7a3588b2a9c.mp4?t=1765027934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/f8642f3aab533faa73d5ebc4ebeef4b4.webp?t=1765027934\" width=1560 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To get anywhere in this world, you'll need friends. Unfortunately, you don't have any. Instead, you'll go up against international bankers, foreign techno-fascists, psychic doppelg\u00e4ngers, a paranoid TV presenter, a man with a box for a heart, and dozens more. Everyone you meet has their own agendas, beliefs, and secrets for you to uncover and turn to your own ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/635b8fdd48aa0489f11b517024d9da71.poster.avif?t=1765027934\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/635b8fdd48aa0489f11b517024d9da71.webm?t=1765027934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/635b8fdd48aa0489f11b517024d9da71.mp4?t=1765027934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/8d5c0b4c0e462d79e42e01ebb8bbcab8.webp?t=1765027934\" width=1560 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fulfil the demands of your assignment by hunting down secrets hidden within the architecture of both the city and the human mind. Collaborate and clash with informants, loyalists, and agitators. Pass skill checks to get them to open up and improve your abilities with the experience you receive. The choices you make affect everything: the loyalty of your friends, the paths you can take, and the fragility of your mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/c38c0e85aa18be60cc0e6b09a7b0c488.poster.avif?t=1765027934\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/c38c0e85aa18be60cc0e6b09a7b0c488.webm?t=1765027934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/c38c0e85aa18be60cc0e6b09a7b0c488.mp4?t=1765027934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/f282fc99f19e66056ac40e9f8d443b99.webp?t=1765027934\" width=1560 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pull on your skills to gain the upper hand in unexpected confrontations with your antagonists. Tactical View pauses time so you can assess your moves and even peek forward in time, as you clash across the urban stage. Encounter what you\u2019re capable of. Encounter your targets... or become theirs. The dice decide your fate but a bad roll isn\u2019t always the end \u2013 though it will definitely hurt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/c8e0cdc26493e1c033ae100d1a659e52.poster.avif?t=1765027934\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/c8e0cdc26493e1c033ae100d1a659e52.webm?t=1765027934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/c8e0cdc26493e1c033ae100d1a659e52.mp4?t=1765027934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/af6e9bd0f7ded5c8798bc8cd658b09ce.webp?t=1765027934\" width=1560 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operants go through years of training to learn how to hone their minds into a weapon. Conditioning lets you reinforce Hershel\u2019s thoughts to shape her identity and unlock new ways forward. It\u2019s our snappier successor to Disco Elysium\u2019s Thought Cabinet, you are not only investigating the past, you are shaping the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/c27eb3e61eaf1bdac0dcf52c440bb090.poster.avif?t=1765027934\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/c27eb3e61eaf1bdac0dcf52c440bb090.webm?t=1765027934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/c27eb3e61eaf1bdac0dcf52c440bb090.mp4?t=1765027934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/ee21bb74f8f79aba83f9c5997557e536.webp?t=1765027934\" width=1560 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pressures simulate the physical and psychological toll of being an operant. Balance your Fatigue, Anxiety, and Delirium \u2013 or face the deadly consequences. Pressures increase during stressful situations but you can also choose to Exert them to roll the dice with advantage \u2013 just remember that you\u2019re gambling with life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/13c5b51542fe887d027bdf9eac76d71e.poster.avif?t=1765027934\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/13c5b51542fe887d027bdf9eac76d71e.webm?t=1765027934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/13c5b51542fe887d027bdf9eac76d71e.mp4?t=1765027934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/484838dfc3f545416a1433d8de88ef95.webp?t=1765027934\" width=1560 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this line of work you're going to fail <strong>way</strong> more often than you succeed. That much is expected of you. What matters is how you pick yourself back up. As an operant, your dice are in the hand of fate. If they don't go your way <i>(and they won't)</i>\u00a0you'll have to improvise and hope the consequences are ones you can live with.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2863680?t=1765027934","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/ccd52916e4c2ac37b3330a90fd92c4f78dba53cc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765027934","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/2a6e743aeefc8b71d220125a26e017a885b2362e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765027934","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/2a6e743aeefc8b71d220125a26e017a885b2362e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765027934","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game contains violent acts including killing, references to sexual activity and use of illegal substances."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Gameplay Features</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/63f4ae47ce2db108e007903f298a79cc.avif?t=1765027934\" width=1560 height=160 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A GRAND SPY RPG -\u00a0</strong>With psychological depth, surrealist undertones, and a rich world to explore.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YOUR SKILLS TALK TO YOU - </strong>Listen to them for advice but be careful to fully trust them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CONDITIONING -\u00a0</strong>Recall and level up your training to build and customize your operant.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DRAMATIC ENCOUNTERS -\u00a0</strong>Freeze time in Tactical View and roll the dice to improvise the impossible.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXERTION -\u00a0</strong>Take penalties and de-buffs to force the dice in your favour. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FAIL FORWARD -</strong> Every closed door is an open opportunity to go through the window instead.</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/8c0e0ea784f8659f10a478bb528d2856.avif?t=1765027934\" width=1560 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brilliant, burnt-out, possibly cursed \u2013 you play as operant Hershel Wilk, alias CASCADE. Five years ago you led your team into the abyss and have been haunted by your failures ever since. Now you've been recalled for a mysterious assignment that may give you a chance to prove yourself again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/a9e26454c722bd843602c65e74f0368a.poster.avif?t=1765027934\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/a9e26454c722bd843602c65e74f0368a.webm?t=1765027934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/a9e26454c722bd843602c65e74f0368a.mp4?t=1765027934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/7d0d5fbf5c24b8f737c831d961a692ce.webp?t=1765027934\" width=1560 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find yourself thrown into a three-way struggle for cultural and ideological power, played out across an unforgettable new city. In ZERO PARADES, the world itself is a character with its own secrets, traumas, and miracles for you to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/394eaba703d25bac2988e7a3588b2a9c.poster.avif?t=1765027934\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/394eaba703d25bac2988e7a3588b2a9c.webm?t=1765027934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/394eaba703d25bac2988e7a3588b2a9c.mp4?t=1765027934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/f8642f3aab533faa73d5ebc4ebeef4b4.webp?t=1765027934\" width=1560 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To get anywhere in this world, you'll need friends. Unfortunately, you don't have any. Instead, you'll go up against international bankers, foreign techno-fascists, psychic doppelg\u00e4ngers, a paranoid TV presenter, a man with a box for a heart, and dozens more. Everyone you meet has their own agendas, beliefs, and secrets for you to uncover and turn to your own ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/635b8fdd48aa0489f11b517024d9da71.poster.avif?t=1765027934\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/635b8fdd48aa0489f11b517024d9da71.webm?t=1765027934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/635b8fdd48aa0489f11b517024d9da71.mp4?t=1765027934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/8d5c0b4c0e462d79e42e01ebb8bbcab8.webp?t=1765027934\" width=1560 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fulfil the demands of your assignment by hunting down secrets hidden within the architecture of both the city and the human mind. Collaborate and clash with informants, loyalists, and agitators. Pass skill checks to get them to open up and improve your abilities with the experience you receive. The choices you make affect everything: the loyalty of your friends, the paths you can take, and the fragility of your mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/c38c0e85aa18be60cc0e6b09a7b0c488.poster.avif?t=1765027934\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/c38c0e85aa18be60cc0e6b09a7b0c488.webm?t=1765027934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/c38c0e85aa18be60cc0e6b09a7b0c488.mp4?t=1765027934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/f282fc99f19e66056ac40e9f8d443b99.webp?t=1765027934\" width=1560 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pull on your skills to gain the upper hand in unexpected confrontations with your antagonists. Tactical View pauses time so you can assess your moves and even peek forward in time, as you clash across the urban stage. Encounter what you\u2019re capable of. Encounter your targets... or become theirs. The dice decide your fate but a bad roll isn\u2019t always the end \u2013 though it will definitely hurt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/c8e0cdc26493e1c033ae100d1a659e52.poster.avif?t=1765027934\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/c8e0cdc26493e1c033ae100d1a659e52.webm?t=1765027934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/c8e0cdc26493e1c033ae100d1a659e52.mp4?t=1765027934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/af6e9bd0f7ded5c8798bc8cd658b09ce.webp?t=1765027934\" width=1560 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operants go through years of training to learn how to hone their minds into a weapon. Conditioning lets you reinforce Hershel\u2019s thoughts to shape her identity and unlock new ways forward. It\u2019s our snappier successor to Disco Elysium\u2019s Thought Cabinet, you are not only investigating the past, you are shaping the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/c27eb3e61eaf1bdac0dcf52c440bb090.poster.avif?t=1765027934\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/c27eb3e61eaf1bdac0dcf52c440bb090.webm?t=1765027934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/c27eb3e61eaf1bdac0dcf52c440bb090.mp4?t=1765027934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/ee21bb74f8f79aba83f9c5997557e536.webp?t=1765027934\" width=1560 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pressures simulate the physical and psychological toll of being an operant. Balance your Fatigue, Anxiety, and Delirium \u2013 or face the deadly consequences. Pressures increase during stressful situations but you can also choose to Exert them to roll the dice with advantage \u2013 just remember that you\u2019re gambling with life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/13c5b51542fe887d027bdf9eac76d71e.poster.avif?t=1765027934\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/13c5b51542fe887d027bdf9eac76d71e.webm?t=1765027934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/13c5b51542fe887d027bdf9eac76d71e.mp4?t=1765027934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/484838dfc3f545416a1433d8de88ef95.webp?t=1765027934\" width=1560 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this line of work you're going to fail <strong>way</strong> more often than you succeed. That much is expected of you. What matters is how you pick yourself back up. As an operant, your dice are in the hand of fate. If they don't go your way <i>(and they won't)</i>\u00a0you'll have to improvise and hope the consequences are ones you can live with.</p>","developers":["ZA/UM"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/9bb6aa338885131045ddb7e124e67b359ea61d90/header.jpg?t=